msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Overview ng mga AI skill para sa mga workflow ng quantum computing gamit ang Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit AI skill"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit AI skill {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "Ang [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) ay may set ng mga skill na magagamit mo kasama ng mga AI assistant, tulad ng Bob, Claude, o ChatGPT. Ang isang AI skill ay isang reusable na set ng mga instructions na nagtuturo sa assistant kung paano kumpletuhin ang isang partikular na task. Nakakatulong ang mga skill na makatipid ng oras at masiguro na ang mga paulit-ulit na task ay nagagawa nang pare-pareho at tama.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first available skill is `migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime`, for migrating `qiskit-ibm-runtime` code.\n"
msgstr "Ang unang available na skill ay ang `migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime`, para sa pag-migrate ng code ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang isang Qiskit AI skill, sundin ang mga instructions para sa iyong AI assistant. Sa pangkalahatan, kailangan mo lang ibigay ang skill sa assistant, tapos sabihin dito kung saan i-apply ang skill.\n"
